{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>בבתוליה [in her virginity].</b> There are nouns in the sacred language that are never separated, such as נעורים, זקונים, עלומים, and בתולים. And there are nouns in the sacred language that do not join, such as נטף, שכם, זהב, and ברזל."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:33.106499258Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}